## 3. MOBILE SOVEREIGNTY
- **Touch Targets**: Minimum **44×44px** hit area. Non-negotiable.
- **Safe Area**: Always `safe-area-inset-*` for notched devices via Tailwind (`pt-safe`, `pb-safe`).
- **Responsive Scaling**: Design for `375px` strictly first. Scale up using `md:` / `lg:` breakpoint modifiers.

## 4. ACCESSIBILITY (WCAG AA & VESTIBULAR DEFENSE)
- **Focus Sovereignty**: Visible `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/50` required for all keyboard-navigable elements. No `outline-none` without custom ring replacements.
- **ARIA Labeling**: Semantic HTML + `aria-label` required on all interactive icon buttons (`<button aria-label="Close modal"> <XIcon /> </button>`).
- **Reduced Motion**: If using `framer-motion`, you MUST import and utilize `useReducedMotion()` to fallback to `opacity` shifts rendering complex y/x axis physics inert for vestibular safety.

## 5. ANTI-PATTERNS (Instant Reject)
- ❌ `style={{}}` inline styling hacks. Use Tailwind.
- ❌ `linear` or standard `ease-in-out` easing. Utilize `spring` physics to make the UI feel reactive and alive.
- ❌ Animations > 400ms. UI feedback must feel crisp and instantaneous.
